      "message": "fix(lint): make the declared lint tool executable again — pin eslint ^8.57.1 (v10 dropped eslintrc), rename .eslintrc.js to .eslintrc.cjs (package type:module), correct extends to plugin:@typescript-eslint/recommended (config package never installed), drop type-aware parserOptions.project (no solution tsconfig covers packages/*) — lint now RUNS and measures the true debt (9027 problems: 5135 errors / 3892 warnings, receipted) instead of failing to load",
